		{"type":"text","id":"step_0","text":"## Cara Baca Peta\nBaca **dari kiri ke kanan**.\nTiap kolom = satu tahapan kerja.\nKartu atas = rangkuman cepat.\nFile bawah = klik untuk membuka catatan.","x":20,"y":40,"width":480,"height":230},
