		{"type":"text","id":"step_1","text":"## 1. Arahan Dosen\nKonsultasi 27 Okt 2026 (Ibu Siti Soraya, M.Si).\n14 Keputusan: K01–K11, adopsi Regresi Harmonik, batas Bab III.","x":660,"y":40,"width":480,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"type":"text","id":"step_2","text":"## 2. Penelitian Terdahulu\n15 Artikel (2016–2026) di Tabel 2.1.\nAstuti (2018): Fourier Mataram, dasar yang dilanjutkan.\nKusdarwati (2023): alur model harmonik, dasar.\nAzmi (2020): Dosen Siti Soraya.","x":1300,"y":40,"width":480,"height":230,"color":"2"},
