		{"type":"text","id":"step_3","text":"## 3. Data\n72 Bulan BPS Kota Mataram (2020–2025).\nSemua dipakai menyusun model.\nStatistik deskriptif.","x":1940,"y":40,"width":480,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"type":"file","id":"n3_0","file":"05 Data/Data BPS 72 Bulan.md","x":1940,"y":310,"width":480,"height":360},
		{"type":"file","id":"n3_1","file":"Berkas/deret_waktu.png","x":1940,"y":710,"width":480,"height":171},
		{"type":"text","id":"step_4","text":"## 4. Alur Kerja OLS Harmonik\n1. Transformasi sin & cos periode 12 bulan.\n2. Estimasi OLS b0, b1, b2.\n3. Uji F: H0 b1 = b2 = 0.\n4. R² dan RMSE; ramal 2026.","x":2580,"y":40,"width":480,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"type":"file","id":"n4_0","file":"06 Metode/Alur Regresi Harmonik.md","x":2580,"y":310,"width":480,"height":360},
		{"type":"text","id":"title","text":"# 🌧️ Peta Proyek: Curah Hujan Kota Mataram dengan Regresi Harmonik\n**Statistika, Universitas Bumigora 2026/2027.** Kelompok 3 (Ahmad Yusuf, Gracia Yusti, Raudhatul Athfal).\nIntinya: 72 bulan data BPS, regresi harmonik k=1 dari seluruh 72 bulan, lalu ramalan 12 bulan 2026. Laporan sampai Bab III.","x":0,"y":-260,"width":4360,"height":200,"color":"6"},
